# Real-Time Chat & Collaboration Platform Implementation Plan

Build a simplified Slack/Discord chat and collaboration platform featuring a modern glassmorphic UI, support for direct and channel-based messaging, typing indicators, read receipts, online/offline presence tracking, file sharing, message search, and unread notifications.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Solution**: To ensure the application runs seamlessly out-of-the-box without requiring a pre-installed MongoDB database, we will use `mongodb-memory-server` as a fallback. If a `MONGODB_URI` environment variable is provided, the backend will connect to it; otherwise, it will spin up an in-memory MongoDB instance automatically.
> **Design Theme**: The platform will feature a high-fidelity dark glassmorphism theme (`glassmorphic-dark`) utilizing modern indigo/violet gradients, backdrop blurs, and micro-interactions.

## Proposed Changes

We will create a monorepo structure in the workspace:
- **`server/`**: Express, Socket.IO, mongoose, jwt, multer.
- **`client/`**: React, Vite, CSS variables for styling, Socket.IO client, lucide-react.
- **Root**: `package.json` orchestrator using `concurrently`.

