## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- We will run a script to start the servers and verify that backend sockets and endpoints respond correctly.

### Manual Verification
- Launch the application: `npm run dev`.
- Register two users (`Alice` and `Bob`) in two browser sessions.
- Verify user presence syncing (Alice sees Bob online, and vice-versa).
- Open direct message chat. Type a message; verify that typing indicators trigger in real time.
- Send a message; check if it displays on both sides instantly. Check read receipts (changes from Sent to Read when open).
- Upload and share a file (image, PDF, text). Confirm that it downloads/opens correctly.
- Test creating a Channel (group chat), adding users, and sending messages.
- Test message search box (searches messages within active channel).
- Check in-app notification indicators when Bob sends a message to Alice while Alice is looking at another channel.
